{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#card-zh","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web（DSH 网页插件）：为内置 web_search 提供无需搜索 API key 的 Bing 搜索。它注册搜索 provider，并通过 bundle 接入 DSH。功能包括解析 Bing 网页或 RSS 结果、可选调用本机 Chrome/Edge 渲染、按会话设置关闭/智能/始终联网模式、始终模式每轮自动搜索，以及侧栏手动搜索。适合需要在 DSH 中查找网页资料或查看搜索结果的用户。无需 API key；Chrome 或 Edge 仅作可选回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:744-758","index.js:1032-1055","index.js:1098-1123","client.js:842-875","cordis.patch.yml:11-18"]}
{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#card-en","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-free-web (DSH web plugin) connects Bing results to the built-in web_search without an API key. It supports HTML/RSS results, optional local Chrome or Edge rendering, per-session Off/Smart/Always modes, automatic searches in Always mode, and a sidebar for manual searches.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:744-758","index.js:1032-1055","index.js:1098-1123","client.js:842-875","cordis.patch.yml:11-18"]}
