{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#feature-1","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web 的功能「Bing 搜索」：为 DSH web_search 提供 Bing 结果，依次尝试 HTML、RSS 和可选的本机 Chrome/Edge 渲染。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:415-484","index.js:537-589","index.js:744-758"]}
{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#feature-2","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web 的功能「按会话控制联网」：在输入框旁的控件为当前会话选择关闭、智能或始终模式。关闭模式会阻止 web_search；智能模式由模型按需调用搜索；始终模式则在每轮开始时自动搜索并把结果加入运行上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-73","index.js:1074-1084","index.js:1098-1123","client.js:602-630","client.js:864-874"]}
{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#feature-3","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web 的功能「侧栏手动搜索」：用户在左侧栏面板输入查询并提交，面板请求搜索路由并显示结果标题、网址和摘要；用户也可以查看搜索引擎状态和所用回退方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:298-324","client.js:327-398","client.js:842-860"]}
{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#feature-4","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web 的功能「保存会话联网模式」：模式会写入 DSH_HOME 下的 free-web/session-modes.json，并在后续加载时读取；未设置的会话使用智能模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-53","index.js:77-108","index.js:111-128"]}
{"unit_id":"skyhome000__dsh-free-web#caveat-1","repo":"skyhome000/dsh-free-web","commit":"e4cc1d548a988b52579fd8b4d778c210e2bc8a9e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-web 会把搜索查询（始终模式下为用户消息）发送到 www.bing.com。（见 index.js:415-439、index.js:1098-1113）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:415-439","index.js:1098-1113"]}
